  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1413.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1413.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to accommodate those situations where strict adherence to the rules would not be in the best interest of the public or the environment.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1400) #12062 eff 12-17-16",
